WEBVTT

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:02.328
Hi, I'm Tamarack!

00:00:02.328 --> 00:00:05.442
Open Math Harness runs maths agents on open models.

00:00:05.442 --> 00:00:08.557
Here is how it decides what they actually proved.

00:00:10.433 --> 00:00:13.817
A small kernel holds every agent to its granted authority.

00:00:13.817 --> 00:00:17.201
In proof search, only Lean decides whether a proof counts.

00:00:19.883 --> 00:00:22.078
A run starts from a frozen Lean statement.

00:00:22.078 --> 00:00:24.822
A policy picks which nodes of the tree to grow.

00:00:25.242 --> 00:00:28.777
Each pick spawns one prover worker, with a model budget, its own

00:00:28.777 --> 00:00:30.251
slot and a Lean tool.

00:00:30.251 --> 00:00:30.840
Nothing else.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:32.995
The worker hands back one candidate.

00:00:32.995 --> 00:00:36.177
Lean judges it, and the score goes back into the tree.

00:00:37.608 --> 00:00:38.732
Here is the formula.

00:00:39.608 --> 00:00:42.538
A file that elaborates with gaps left starts at one half.

00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:46.009
C counts closed steps that automation alone cannot prove.

00:00:46.429 --> 00:00:47.624
L counts open gaps.

00:00:47.624 --> 00:00:50.613
A gap that makes the theorem trivial zeroes the credit.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:53.587
A solve has to pass five checks.

00:00:54.489 --> 00:00:57.190
No sorry, no new axiom, nothing that runs code.

00:00:57.610 --> 00:01:00.800
The frozen definitions and statement, kept word for word.

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:02.728
Lean's kernel checks the proof.

00:01:03.484 --> 00:01:05.203
Only the three standard axioms.

00:01:05.971 --> 00:01:08.410
And the elaborated type must match exactly.

00:01:09.633 --> 00:01:12.074
I ran its verifier on twelve candidates.

00:01:12.074 --> 00:01:12.771
Three passed.

00:01:12.771 --> 00:01:14.515
Seven forgeries never reached Lean.

00:01:14.515 --> 00:01:18.700
One changed what times means, and only the type check caught it.

00:01:20.633 --> 00:01:25.238
Ultramath is the chat side: agents take different directions and share findings.

00:01:25.658 --> 00:01:29.555
Here a model judges each submission, and the code admits a persuasive

00:01:29.555 --> 00:01:30.853
wrong answer can pass.

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:33.774
Lean checks the proof.

00:01:33.774 --> 00:01:36.207
Nothing checks that the statement means the problem.

00:01:36.207 --> 00:01:38.031
That is still a person's job.

00:01:40.483 --> 00:01:42.225
A kernel limits every agent.

00:01:42.225 --> 00:01:43.618
Lean decides proof search.

00:01:43.618 --> 00:01:45.011
People check the rest.

00:01:45.431 --> 00:01:47.593
Every source is in the full article.

00:01:47.593 --> 00:01:48.210
I'm Tamarack.

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:48.519
Bye!
